 automatically skip and gracefully remove themselves from your playback queue to prevent silent hang-ups.\r\n- **Streamlined UI Layout**: The visual padding and home feed elements have been refined for a sleeker, more premium look.\r\n\r\n## Installation\r\nYou can install this update by downloading the `.flatpak` bundle below and running:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nflatpak install --user Meduza_Music-1.2.0-x86_64.flatpak\r\n```\r\n- **known issues**: yt-dlp not found when app startup.(will fix soon)"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akilaisadev/meduza-music/releases/360961683","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akilaisadev/meduza-music/releases/360961683/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/akilaisadev/meduza-music/releases/360961683/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/akilaisadev/meduza-music/releases/tag/v1.0.0","id":360961683,"author":{"login":"akilaisadev","id":185268001,"node_id":"U_kgDOCwr3IQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185268001?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akilaisadev","html_url":"https://github.com/akilaisadev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akilaisadev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akilaisadev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akilaisadev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akilaisadev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akilaisadev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akilaisadev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akilaisadev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akilaisadev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akilaisadev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOTPbHis4Vg9aT","tag_name":"v1.0.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"Meduza Music v1.0.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerele